1.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2122/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_H1.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2122/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_H1.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2122/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_H1.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2122/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_H1.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2122/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_H1.jpg","In the world of life sciences, identifying and connecting with the right healthcare professionals is a crucial part of the drug discovery process. Sadly, data is notoriously fragmented, opaque and siloed in the healthcare industry—it’s typically impossible to see an HCP’s entire background, including publications, clinical trials and conferences, on a single platform. Or it was until H1 came along.\r\n\r\nH1 is the most comprehensive platform of its kind, aggregating real-time data on over 9 million HCPs across 70 countries, 700 medical societies, 16,000 healthcare organizations, 350,000 clinical trials and 160 million peer-reviewed publications. By connecting all stakeholders in the healthcare ecosystem, the medtech startup enables greater collaboration and discovery. With H1’s critical information at their fingertips, teams in the life sciences industry can accelerate the development of medical devices and therapeutics that will save countless lives.","H1 is a comprehensive data and research platform supporting drug discovery teams in identifying and connecting with the right healthcare professionals. ","H1 - IVP Portfolio - VC for Enterprise Healthcare Technology","H1 - IVP Portfolio  ","H1 is the trusted source for healthcare professional information for life sciences, payors, providers, and patients. From bench to bedside, H1’s solutions make healthcare information and evidence-based medicine accessible to everyone globally, leading to improved clinical outcomes, workflow efficiency and business impact.","A global platform for the healthcare ecosystem",{"id":33,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":9,"assetUrlXs":9,"assetUrlSm":9,"assetUrlMd":9,"assetUrlLg":9,"assetUrlXl":9,"assetUrlXxl":9},"307","2020-01-01","https://careers.ivp.com/companydetail.php?cid=21872&v=7","Ariel Katz","/content/hi-connecting-life-sciences/","Read the Funding Announcement","https://www.linkedin.com/company/h1co/",{"id":41,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":42,"assetUrlXs":43,"assetUrlSm":44,"assetUrlMd":45,"assetUrlLg":46,"assetUrlXl":47,"assetUrlXxl":48},"309","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/309/H1_Logo.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/309/xs_H1_Logo.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/309/sm_H1_Logo.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/309/md_H1_Logo.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/309/lg_H1_Logo.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/309/xl_H1_Logo.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/309/xxl_H1_Logo.jpg","Founded 2017\r\nPartnered 2020","H1","h1",{"id":53,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":9,"assetUrlXs":9,"assetUrlSm":9,"assetUrlMd":9,"assetUrlLg":9,"assetUrlXl":9,"assetUrlXxl":9},"306",{"name":55,"slug":56},"Active","active",[58,61],{"fullName":59,"slug":60},"Jules Maltz","jules-maltz",{"fullName":62,"slug":63},"Somesh Dash","somesh-dash",{"id":65,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":66,"assetUrlXs":67,"assetUrlSm":68,"assetUrlMd":69,"assetUrlLg":70,"assetUrlXl":71,"assetUrlXxl":72},"308","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/308/H1.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/308/xs_H1.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/308/sm_H1.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/308/md_H1.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/308/lg_H1.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae